License: GPL-3+
Comment: These files are not under the Apache-2.0, BSD-3-clause or EPL-1.0
 licences that licensecheck finds in them. Copyright.pm holds the Apache-2.0
 header text that dh-make-scala writes into the debian/copyright of the
 packages it generates. t/lib.pl builds a fictional upstream project for the
 tests, with the holder "Example Corp." and an Apache-2.0 header;
 t/make.expected/debian/copyright is the debian/copyright expected for that
 project, and t/make-package.t checks it. t/make-copyright.t builds a
 fictional project with a BSD-3-clause LICENSE and checks the licence names
 and paragraphs dh-make-scala writes.

